WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,081 --> 00:00:03,448
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,498 --> 00:00:05,872
This is Episode 56.

3
00:00:05,922 --> 00:00:07,297
Night time.

4
00:00:07,347 --> 00:00:09,497
A muddy blob sneaks up.

5
00:00:09,547 --> 00:00:11,486
It pops off the lock.

6
00:00:11,536 --> 00:00:13,623
It paints the roof brown.

7
00:00:13,673 --> 00:00:14,899
Oh no!

8
00:00:14,949 --> 00:00:16,164
Morning.

9
00:00:16,214 --> 00:00:18,291
Maya looks at her stand.

10
00:00:18,341 --> 00:00:20,067
Something is wrong.

11
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:21,353
But what?

12
00:00:21,403 --> 00:00:23,363
Here comes the blueprint.

13
00:00:23,413 --> 00:00:25,032
It glows red!

14
00:00:25,082 --> 00:00:26,797
Maya holds it up.

15
00:00:26,847 --> 00:00:28,902
The drawing has stripes.

16
00:00:28,952 --> 00:00:30,710
The roof has none.

17
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,709
The drawing has a lock.

18
00:00:32,759 --> 00:00:34,527
The box has none.

19
00:00:34,577 --> 00:00:36,164
Two changes!

20
00:00:36,214 --> 00:00:38,227
She paints the stripes.

21
00:00:38,277 --> 00:00:39,354
Click!

22
00:00:39,404 --> 00:00:40,832
A new lock.

23
00:00:40,882 --> 00:00:42,575
Now it matches.

24
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:44,670
The blueprint glows blue.

25
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:47,392
The blueprint shows how things should look.

26
00:00:47,442 --> 00:00:49,518
And spots what changed.

27
00:00:49,568 --> 00:00:51,411
That is the blueprint.

28
00:00:51,461 --> 00:00:54,197
Now you know AWS Config!

29
00:00:54,247 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
